 119019\n\nNYLT\n\nNational Youth Leadership Training (NYLT)\nis a 6-day l
 eadership experience for youth registered in Scouts BSA\, Venturing\, or 
 Sea Scouts. It’s designed for Scouts who want to grow as leaders and fo
 r units that believe in a strong\, youth-led program. Many troops even re
 quire NYLT for Senior Patrol Leaders because it helps youth leaders under
 stand not just what leadership is\, but how to live it. We find that many
  troops will cover 50-100% of the participant fee as a way of investing i
 nto the troop'
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/429-119019
